TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CO2(g) 0.4 10
    CH4(g) 0.4 10
    NH3(g) 0.2 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals C
    -molalities CO2 HCO3- CO3-2 CH4
END
